    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2162",
      "reading_order": 2839,
      "section": "Defrosting Operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.52818450000007,
        "t": 615.1701354600002,
        "r": 551.5548122599994,
        "b": 590.3068632600002
      },
      "content": "When defrosting begins, compressor will stop for one minute, external fan is running    and 50s later, four-way valve will be off.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2838",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5.Funcitions and Control"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_2838",
          "title": "Defrosting Operation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 266,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2163",
      "reading_order": 2840,
      "section": "Defrosting Operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.52818450000007,
        "t": 583.9884078600003,
        "r": 551.5578150800009,
        "b": 559.1251356600003
      },
      "content": "When compressor starts, external fan will be off, compressor will run at 58Hz for 60s then move on to target frequency of 88Hz.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2838",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5.Funcitions and Control"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_2838",
          "title": "Defrosting Operation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 266,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2164",
      "reading_order": 2841,
      "section": "Defrosting Operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.52818450000007,
        "t": 552.8066802600003,
        "r": 551.5418000400001,
        "b": 481.1698153200003
      },
      "content": "During defrosting, compressor current and air discharge overheat protection features are effective. During  defrosting,  if  compressor  shuts  down  due  to  activation  of  protection  feature  or  due  to malfunction, it will  resume after 3 minutes. In the unit is still within defrosting cycle, it will resume defrosting and startup of compressor will be based on the rule for defrosting startup. (The unit will exit defrosting mode and handle fault in the event of 3 consecutive restart failures.)",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2838",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5.Funcitions and Control"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_2838",
          "title": "Defrosting Operation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 266,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2165",
      "reading_order": 2842,
      "section": "Defrosting Operation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.52818450000007,
        "t": 474.8513599200003,
        "r": 551.5548122600007,
        "b": 449.98808772000024
      },
      "content": "On entering defrosting, it must guarantee that compressor will operate for a minimum of 2 minutes in defrosting mode before exit.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_2838",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5.Funcitions and Control"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_2838",
          "title": "Defrosting Operation"
        }
      ],
      "page": 266,
